Hello everyone in this group.

Just a small question, could anyone let me know why the option ‘conditional.x = TRUE’ is the default when there are some categorical endogenous variables in the data and hence, polychoric correlations are computed before estimating the model in WLSMV?

I guess that the purpose of using polychoric correlations is to simulate the correspondence between the two corresponding observed categorical responses. So they should be treated as a form of input data and hence, covariates should be partialled out in calculating them.

Many thanks.

Yen.

